WEBVTT

00:02:00.074 --> 00:02:02.535
What I'm showing you right now

00:02:02.577 --> 00:02:06.205
are persistent, endless virtual worlds

00:02:06.247 --> 00:02:08.958
where players can have
lots of fun together.

00:02:09.458 --> 00:02:11.711
They are worlds that connect people.

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:16.549
Each of these worlds were made
by individuals in Minecraft.

00:02:17.049 --> 00:02:21.053
By removing and placing
their own virtual building blocks,

00:02:21.095 --> 00:02:24.182
They could create anything
they can imagine.

00:02:24.515 --> 00:02:29.770
And to me, these are creative
and delightful examples of metaverses.